  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Minecraft-1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client & Server-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Horse Expert</strong> 能通过显示所有相关的马匹统计数据，极大地帮助你挑选心仪的坐骑。但等等，事情没那么简单！你得先制作并装备一个单片眼镜。然后只需看向一匹马即可查看其详细信息（马必须已被驯服，此条件可配置）。对羊驼同样有效，且会显示额外信息！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 截图：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\"><tbody><tr><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/961/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td><td>  </td><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/962/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td></tr><tr><td><strong>谁能想到你的马居然这么厉害？</strong></td><td>  </td><td><strong>普通的羊驼</strong></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/963/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td><td>  </td><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/964/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td></tr><tr><td><strong>学识造就非凡风范</strong></td><td>  </td><td><strong>制作单片眼镜</strong></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Forge 上配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安装我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，即可直接在游戏内完成配置！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Fabric 上配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未实现在游戏内直接编辑配置文件的功能。取而代之的是，当你在世界中时，运行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 命令，选择 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（具体取决于模组），然后点击聊天栏中出现的文件名（以 .toml 结尾），即可在外部编辑器中手动修改配置文件。保存文件后，配置文件将在几秒后自动在游戏内重新加载，无需重启游戏。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开发 Easy Magic 的过程得到了以下启发与帮助：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/teaj4y\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>TeaJ4y</strong></span></a> 因其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horsestatsvanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Horse Stats Vanilla</span></a> 模组而启发了本项目</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ron0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Ron0</strong></span></a> 制作了精美的单片眼镜纹理</span></li></ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MynoO6R.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GCYM7Zl.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
